{"seq":2,"slug":"light-probes-gi","title":"光照探针与 GI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/global-illumination/light-probes-gi","wordCount":1438,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"光照探针与-gi\">光照探针与 GI</h1><p><a href=\"baked-lightmaps\">烘焙光照贴图</a> 把间接光烤进了墙和地板的纹理，但一个会跑动的角色没有 lightmap UV，它走到红墙边时该被染上多少暖光？答案是：在空间里预先撒一批采样点，每个点存下「从这里看四面八方，间接光各是多少」，角色走到哪就从最近的几个点插值出它身上的间接光。这些采样点就是光照探针（light probes）。它是把烘焙从「表面」推广到「整个空间」的关键一步，让动态物体也能融进静态环境的光里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-在空间里采样辐照度场\">核心概念：在空间里采样辐照度场</h2><p>lightmap 是定义在表面上的二维间接光，探针是定义在空间中的离散辐照度场。烘焙时，在每个探针位置向四面八方追踪光线，求出它收到的、随方向变化的间接辐照度，压缩存下。运行时，一个动态物体取它周围探针的数据做插值，再结合自身法线，重建出每个表面点应有的间接光。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[场景中布置探针网格] --&gt; B[离线: 每探针向全方向追踪]&#10;  B --&gt; C[得到方向性辐照度&lt;br/&gt;用球谐 SH 压缩]&#10;  C --&gt; D[运行时: 动态物体定位]&#10;  D --&gt; E[找周围探针&lt;br/&gt;四面体/网格插值]&#10;  E --&gt; F[结合像素法线&lt;br/&gt;重建间接光]&#10;  F --&gt; G[动态物体融入环境光]\">flowchart TD\n  A[场景中布置探针网格] --&gt; B[离线: 每探针向全方向追踪]\n  B --&gt; C[得到方向性辐照度&lt;br/&gt;用球谐 SH 压缩]\n  C --&gt; D[运行时: 动态物体定位]\n  D --&gt; E[找周围探针&lt;br/&gt;四面体/网格插值]\n  E --&gt; F[结合像素法线&lt;br/&gt;重建间接光]\n  F --&gt; G[动态物体融入环境光]</pre><p>探针存的「随方向变化的间接光」怎么压缩，是整套技术的数学核心——下一节细讲。这里要先把它和 lightmap 的分工钉死：表面用 lightmap，体积用探针，二者烘焙时一起算、保证一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"球谐-用九个数装下半球的光\">球谐：用九个数装下半球的光</h2><p>直接存「每个方向的辐照度」要存成百上千个值，太奢侈。漫反射间接光有个救命的性质——它在方向上极其平滑（低频）。于是可以用球谐函数（Spherical Harmonics, SH）这套定义在球面上的正交基，只用前几阶系数就能很好地逼近它。实践中二阶 SH（9 个系数/颜色通道，RGB 共 27 个浮点）就足以重建漫反射间接光，这是工业界的甜点。</p>\n<p>重建时，给定表面法线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用 SH 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{lm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与对应基函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{lm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 加权求和即得该方向的辐照度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></munderover><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mi>l</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(\\vec{n}) = \\sum_{l=0}^{2}\\sum_{m=-l}^{l} c_{lm}\\, Y_{lm}(\\vec{n})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1966em;vertical-align:-1.3604em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3604em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示</th>\n<th>系数量/通道</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单 RGB（环境光）</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>极廉价占位</td>\n<td>无方向，全向同色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二阶 SH</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>漫反射间接光（主流）</td>\n<td>高频镜面无法表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三阶+ SH</td>\n<td>16+</td>\n<td>略锐的间接光</td>\n<td>内存翻倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>探针立方体图</td>\n<td>一张 cubemap</td>\n<td>镜面反射探针</td>\n<td>大、需单独一套</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SH 的低频本质决定了它只擅长漫反射间接光；镜面反射那种锐利的、随视角变的高光，SH 表达不了，要用另一套反射探针（reflection probe，存 cubemap）。这也是同一个 <a href=\"../foundations/lighting-models\">光照模型 BRDF</a> 里漫反射与镜面分家在 GI 阶段的回响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探针布置-四面体-体积与漏光\">探针布置：四面体、体积与漏光</h2><p>探针怎么摆，决定插值质量。早期用稀疏手摆探针 + Delaunay 四面体化，动态物体落在哪个四面体里就用四个顶点插值——省内存但布置是手工脏活，且四面体外（如刚跨过门框）会突变。现代主流转向规则的三维网格（探针体积，如 Unity 的 Adaptive Probe Volumes、Unreal 的 ILC/Volumetric Lightmap），按密度自动铺满空间，密度可随区域自适应。</p>\n<p>最大的敌人是漏光（light leaking）：探针网格穿墙时，墙内（本该全黑）的探针和墙外（明亮）的探针被插值混在一起，导致暗室里渗进本不该有的光。缓解手段包括存探针到几何的距离做有效性测试（DDGI 的可见性测试思想，见 <a href=\"realtime-gi\">实时 GI</a>）、把探针贴合几何表面、或人工调整网格。漏光是探针 GI 永远在和它搏斗的顽疾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"体积雾与镜面-探针的两个延伸\">体积雾与镜面：探针的两个延伸</h2><p>探针不止照亮固体表面。把 SH 探针沿视线方向积分，可以照亮空气里的体积雾、烟、光柱——让一束光穿过有灰尘的房间时，连空气都被间接光染色，这是体积光照（volumetric lighting）的基础。另一个延伸是前面提到的反射探针：在房间关键位置烤几张 cubemap，给金属、湿地面提供环境镜面反射，运行时按粗糙度选 mip 层、按位置混合最近的几个探针。</p>\n<p>这两个延伸暴露了探针体系的全貌：漫反射用 SH 探针、镜面用 cubemap 探针、体积用沿线积分的探针，三套数据共同拼出一个物体在动态环境里完整的间接光。它们都建立在「离线采样、运行时插值」这一与烘焙同源的思想上，区别只在采样的是表面还是空间。真正让这些探针能随光源实时刷新、而非离线烤死的，是下一节的实时 GI。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>光照探针是定义在空间中的离散辐照度场，让没有 lightmap UV 的动态物体也能接间接光。</li>\n<li>漫反射间接光低频，用二阶球谐（9 系数/通道）即可高质量重建，是工业甜点。</li>\n<li>SH 只擅长漫反射；镜面间接光用单独的 cubemap 反射探针。</li>\n<li>现代用规则探针体积自动铺满空间；最大顽疾是穿墙漏光，靠可见性测试缓解。</li>\n<li>探针还可延伸到体积雾照明与镜面反射，三套数据拼出完整间接光。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"baked-lightmaps\">烘焙光照贴图</a>：探针与 lightmap 配套——表面用图、空间用探针。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"realtime-gi\">实时 GI (Lumen/DDGI)</a>：让探针随光源实时更新的现代方案。</li>\n<li>同库 <a href=\"../foundations/lighting-models\">光照模型 BRDF</a>：漫反射/镜面分家在 GI 阶段决定 SH vs cubemap。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/vfx-craft/shaders-for-vfx\">VFX · VFX 着色器</a>：体积光与粒子如何采探针融入光照。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光照探针与 GI","id":"光照探针与-gi"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：在空间里采样辐照度场","id":"核心概念-在空间里采样辐照度场"},{"level":2,"text":"球谐：用九个数装下半球的光","id":"球谐-用九个数装下半球的光"},{"level":2,"text":"探针布置：四面体、体积与漏光","id":"探针布置-四面体-体积与漏光"},{"level":2,"text":"体积雾与镜面：探针的两个延伸","id":"体积雾与镜面-探针的两个延伸"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"烘焙光照贴图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/global-illumination/baked-lightmaps"},"next":{"title":"实时 GI (Lumen/DDGI)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/global-illumination/realtime-gi"}}